        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakakwiŋijayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi mwituŋa diwakaya nakudiheta, chakatemunayi kuwakayeyi nyuza yayivulu, niaHiti, niaGirigashi, niaAmori, ni aKenani, ni aPerizi, niaHivi, niaYebusi, nyuza yitanu nayi yedi yakubadi keyi nikutoha niŋovu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chakayihanayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi kuwakayeyi, chiwakayitaŋa chiŋa wakayijilumuni chikupu, kutiyaŋana nawuchitiyaŋenu nehi, kuyimwekeshela luwi nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusumbwaŋana nawu nehi, mwaneyi wamumbanda kumwinkayi mwanindi weyala nehi, hela mwanindi wamumbanda kumusumbwilayi mwaneyi weyala nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenda kakubalu mwina mwaneyi weyala hakaleka kunlondela, hakapesha akishi, hiyakayizuwila kudi Yehova, hakakujilumuna swayi swayi hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chimwakayikoŋa; tumeŋa twawu mwakatuhumoni, tuposhitwawu twakupeshela twemikawu mwakatufumpoli puchi puchi, ninyiyombuyawu mwakayitemi, niakishi awu akusoŋa mwakayochi mukesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋenu muyantu ajila, mwamujilila Yehova Nzambi yenu; Yehova Nzambi yenu nayitondi dehi mwikali antu ambala ayena hohu, akwambula mudi antu ejima adi hewulu deseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hashili muchima hadenu, hela kuyitonda, nindi mwabadika nyuza yacheŋi kuvulaku; muloŋa yenu mwabadikilikukeha hadi nyuza yejima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chayifumishiliyi Yehova nachikasa chaŋovu, hakuyikúula mwitala dawuduŋu kudi Fwaro mwanta wakuEjipitu, chafumini hakukeŋa kwayikeŋayi Yehova, nihakukakela kusanyika kwasanyikililiyi ankakulula jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu ilukaku neyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi diyi Nzambi; diyi Nzambi washinshika, wakakelaŋaa nimwatiyaŋeniyi, nimuluwi lwindi, nawantu amukeŋa ahembaŋa kuleja kwindi, kushikani kwikombakaji damakiŋu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amuhela wayifwetelaŋa kumesu awu, yowu kuyijilumuna; wamuhela hakahema ninduku, wakamufwetela kumesu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu chiŋa wakahembaŋa nimukuleja, nimuyidika, nimuwuŋaŋamu nakuleji lelu, wilumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamona, chiwakatiyilila muwuŋaji iwu nakuhembamu nakwilamu, Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakakuhembela chitiyaŋenu naluwi lwasanyikililiyi ankakulula jeyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakakukeŋa, wakakukiswila nkisu, wakakuvulisha; wakakiswila nianyaneyi, nimbutu yaheseki deyi, yoyu tidiku yeyi, navinyuyeyi, namanji eyi, nianyana kaŋombi jeyi, nianyana kanyikoku yeyi, mwituŋa dasanyikililiyi ankakulula jeyi kukwinkadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabadika nyuza yejima kukooleka; hela kudenu, hela kuyimuna yenu, hela weyala, hela wamumbanda hikwakekala nshintaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakayifumishila kukata kwejima; nyisoŋu yatama yamuEjipitu yiweluka hakakwinkayuku, wakenka antu ejimaakuheleyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanoŋesha nyuza yejima yakakwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi; disu deyi bayi dakayitala naluwuku, bayi wakapesha akishi awuku, chakenda kekala muhetu wakufweyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wakela mumuchima weyi neyi, Nyuzoyu yambadikami kuvula nukuyimwaŋamu ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayi wakayitiya womaku; wakaanukaŋa chachiwahi chayikoŋeluwu aFwaro nawaEjipitu ejima kudi Yehova Nzambi yeyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kweseka kweneni kumwamweni namesu enu, niyinjikijilu, niyihayamisha, nichikasa chaŋovu, nichikasa chakwolola, chakufumishiliyi nachu Yehova Nzambi yeyi; dimu mwakayikoŋayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi nyuza yejima yiwunatiyi woma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakatemesha mayanvu mukachikawu, nichakajilu mukawu anashali anabatami kumwakayenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakayizaala womaku; muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi wekala mukachi keyi, hiNzambi muneni wakutiya woma nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuzoyu Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakayitemuna kuwakayeyi anti anti, hiwakatwesha kuyinoŋesha iŋanda dimuku, kuchina anyama amumpata kukusemunwinamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova Nzambi yeyi wakakwinkawu kuwakayeyi, wakayikumpaŋesha kukumpaŋeshakwakweni, ninichi chakajilumukawu to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akahana nianyanta jawu ankanu kudeyi, wakajiyisha nimajinawu mwishina dewulu; kwosi muntuniwumu wakadikaŋa naneyuku, ninichi chiwakayi jilumuna to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akishi awu akusoŋa kufwikŋa akishi awu, mwakayochi mukesi, bayi wakafwila helasiliva hela wuru wuduhuku, hela kuyinona tuhu nehi; mwakenza kafwamuneyi chakufwa mumuhetu; muloŋa hichuma chakushima kudi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakeŋa a chuma chakushimana mwitala deyuku, wakenza kashiŋewa hamu nachu; chiŋa wuchitiyaŋa kutama nankashi, wuchitiyaŋa kumuchima bwi chikupu; muloŋa hichuma chashiŋewa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
